2. Use an existing Kotlin/Compose application with Material 3 and a compatible Kotlin version supporting data objects.
3. Confirm approved dependencies for coroutines, lifecycle ViewModel, lifecycle ViewModel Compose, and lifecycle runtime Compose. Keep the project's existing version catalog and Compose BOM configuration.
