The Kotlin domain/data core compiled with the available compiler and passed **15 controlled behavior cases**, including validation, result mapping, unknown failure, and cancellation propagation. The Android ViewModel/Compose files and JUnit target have **not** been compiled or run in the actual application here. Diagram rendering, device interaction, localization, accessibility, and production transport integration require project verification.

