| **New order action** | Replace the confirmed-demo reset with the actual business lifecycle. Unknown outcomes must be reconciled first. |
| **Foundations** | Use approved localization, design tokens, safe-area handling, accessibility announcements, consent, telemetry, and session cleanup. Demo strings and inline colors are teaching UI. |

Thunk abort or screen unmount does not undo an already-dispatched backend write. This reference has no automatic abort-on-unmount behavior or cancellation transport contract; if the real app adds them, preserve unknown-outcome recovery and stale-result protection.

