**Scope:** Examples illustrate foundation contracts and integration patterns. They are not a replacement for the SDK catalog's versioned installation instructions. Native setup, generated resources, application configuration, Redux registration, and service adapters must be supplied by the host application. The separate SDK catalog currently lists only Auth SDK, with technical details pending. Foundation examples are not additional published SDK entries. Examples include executable adapter/coordinator logic as well as required host contracts. Code here has not been compiled in your project; native resources, service bindings, and library-version compatibility still need project validation.

