Use the dedicated [Push Notifications & Deep Linking](./push-notifications/index.mdx) section for complete setup and service templates. The following blocks explain the foundation boundary; their example payloads are not a confirmed backend contract.

**Responsibility:** Manage registration and token changes, adapt OS callbacks, and convert untrusted notification data into authorized in-app navigation.

Push delivery is not a reliable transaction or an authorization signal. The app must recover authoritative state when it starts, resumes, or reconnects even when no push arrived.

